---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/mr726.png';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Uncle Lab"
	description="Uncle Lab is my personal tech notebook."
	pubDate={new Date('September 26 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Uncle Lab is my personal tech notebook.
	</p>

	<p>
		I use this site to document the things I am learning and building: Docker containers, reverse proxy setup,
		self-hosted tools, GitHub Pages, ServiceNow, ITSM, cloud basics and whatever else I break and fix along the way.
	</p>

	<p>
		Most posts here are written from the viewpoint of a working IT ops person, not a full-time developer or cloud architect. 
		That means I care about the boring but important parts: setup steps, operational risks, maintenance, rollback, cost, 
		documentation and whether the thing can survive real use.
	</p>

	<p>
		This blog is not meant to be perfect. It is a workshop bench. Some notes will be polished, some will be rough
		but the goal is simple: record the learning before it disappears.			
	</p>

</Layout>
